<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight about our baggage freight services.&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;<br />
As your freight is originating&nbsp;outside&nbsp;of Australia, we are unable to assist with your request.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<br />
We would advise you to make contact with a customs licenced freight forwarding company to assist you further. We are unable to recommend a particular company but you will find many on any internet search engine.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
It is recommended that you obtain several quotes as you may find prices and services will vary greatly between companies.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Alternatively, you can also contact the passenger team to ask about adding extra baggage to your ticket.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
We are sorry that we are not able to assist you directly and wish you the best of luck with this matter.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Kind Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br clear="none" />
<strong>Customer Service</strong>&nbsp;<br />
Qantas Freight<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
Link Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br clear="none" />
P. 13 12 13<br clear="none" />
E. <a href="mailto:freightcustomerservice@qantas.com.au" shape="rect" target="_blank">freightcustomerservice@qantas.com.au</a></span></span><br clear="none" />
